---
description: TypeScript / Next.js / React naming convention
alwaysApply: true
---

# Naming

No Hungarian notation (`t`, `I`, `arr`). TypeScript already distinguishes types from values.

## Values and types

| Form | Use | Example |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `CONSTANT_EXAMPLE` | immutable constant / enum-object value | `TOKEN_MAX_AGE`, `modelEnum.ARTIFACT` |
| `is` / `can` / `has` / `should` + Pascal | boolean | `isPending`, `canUpgrade`, `hasToken` |
| `examples` (plural) | array / list | `plans`, `billings` |
| `example` | singular value (object, string, number, …) | `subscription`, `token` |
| `examplesObject` / `exampleById` | map / record | `SEGMENT_KEYS`, `storesById` |
| `ExamplesUnion` | union type | `BillingMethod` (via `z.infer`) |
| `exampleEnum` + `EXAMPLE` keys | `as const` enum-object | `billingMethodEnum.PIX` |
| `Example` | inferred entity type | `type Plan = z.infer<typeof planSchema>` |
| `ExampleProps` | component props (always export) | `FeedbackListProps` |
| `ExamplePageParams` | route params (`useParams`) | `ProjectDiagramPageParams` |

Do not use: `ExampleInterface`, `ExampleType` as a mandatory suffix, nor `IExample` / `tExample`.

## React / Next

| Form | Use | Example |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `ExampleThing` | component (named export) | `LandingPlansSection` |
| `ExampleProvider` | provider | `AuthUserProvider` |
| `ExampleContext` | context | `AuthUserContext` |
| `useExample` | generic hook | `useAuthUser`, `useLocalStorage` |
| `ExamplePage` | comments/docs only — the file is `page.tsx` with `export default` | — |
| `ExampleLayout` | docs only — the file is `layout.tsx` | — |
| `onExample` | callback prop | `onCreated`, `onUpgraded` |
| `handleExample` | local handler | `handleSave`, `onSubmit` |
| `exampleRef` | ref | `formRef` |

Files and folders: **kebab-case** (`use-list-plans.ts`, `payment-details.tsx`).  
Exports: named only (except `page.tsx` / `layout.tsx` / … in the App Router).

## Schemas and API (Zod)

| Form | Use | Example |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `exampleSchema` | base entity | `planSchema` |
| `exampleNewSchema` | create body | `billingNewSchema` |
| `exampleEditSchema` | update body | `projectEditSchema` |
| `exampleListDataSchema` | list envelope | `planListDataSchema` |
| `exampleShowDataSchema` | show envelope | `subscriptionShowDataSchema` |
| `example*BodySchema` | named request body | `signInBodySchema` |
| `example*DataSchema` | response data | `signInDataSchema` |

Entity type: `type Example = z.infer<typeof exampleSchema>` — do not duplicate fields in an `interface`.

## Request hooks

| Form | Use | Example |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `useListExamples` | GET collection | `useListPlans` |
| `useShowExample` | GET one | `useShowSubscription` |
| `useNewExample` | POST create | `useNewBilling` |
| `useEditExample` | PUT/PATCH | `useEditProject` |
| `useDropExample` | DELETE | `useDropProject` |
| domain verb | business action | `useUpgradeSubscription` |

File: `src/hooks/request/{entity}/queries|mutations/use-{action}-{entity}.ts`.  
`queryKey` / `mutationKey`: `'{entity}.{action}'` (register it in `tan-stack-react-query.d.ts`).

## Stores

| Form | Use |
| --- | --- |
| `useExampleStore` | client store (Zustand/etc.), if one exists |

Prefer React Query for server state; use a store only for UI/client state.

## Events and handlers (extra)

| Form | Use |
| --- | --- |
| `onExample` | event prop coming from the parent |
| `handleExample` | implementation in the component |
| `withExample` | HOC / wrapper |
| `getExample` / `setExample` | pure getter/setter |
| `formatExample` / `parseExample` | pure transformation |
| `toExample` / `fromExample` | representation conversion |

## i18n and env (extra)

| Form | Use |
| --- | --- |
| `pages.example.*` / `nav.example` | static i18n key |
| `*_dynamic.${key}` | dynamic i18n key |
| `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` | client env |
| `E2E_*` | E2E test only env |

## E2E tests (extra)

| Form | Use |
| --- | --- |
| `tests/e2e/{domain}/{method}/{behavior}.spec.ts` | spec |
| `uniqueEmail` / `buildTestUser` | fixture factory |
| `gotoExample` / `fillExampleForm` | page helper |

## Anti-patterns

```ts
// ❌
tProjectProps
IUser
ProjectInterface
useProjectQuery   // prefer useShowProject / useListProjects
arrPlans

// ✅
ProjectLinkProps
User
type Project = z.infer<typeof projectSchema>
useShowProject
plans
```
